Responsibilities and obligations of the Controller General
9. The responsibilities of the Controller General are set out below.

(a) Bearing all responsibility for running and overseeing Maldives Immigration in the manner set out in this law;

(b) Carrying out the following matters to ensure that immigration officers are a body that carries out its responsibilities in a responsible manner and in a manner that holds them accountable;

(1) Under a [unclear] principle, introducing the rights of immigration officers, and arranging the employment matters of those officers responsibly, with accountability, and on fair and equal principles;

(2) Setting the conduct and ethical standards of immigration officers;

(3) A system [unclear] action against officers who violate the law or the standards of conduct

